WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.303
Bring your log. Keep your history.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:10.383
Keep your log in a spreadsheet. Copy the cells, then tap Paste. You can also choose a file or get a template.

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:17.892
Write it your way. Eighty by two by three works. When a name is unclear, you choose what it means.

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:24.092
You see every set before anything is saved. Your choices are listed, so nothing is guessed.

00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:30.524
Undo removes exactly what the import added. Personal records stay off until you switch them on.

00:00:30.967 --> 00:00:35.239
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
